          "eligibilityDescription_md": "&gt; **For Farmer:**\n\n\n  - The beneficiary should be a Farmer.\n  - The beneficiary should be a resident of Tamil Nadu.\n  - The beneficiary should be willing to adopt Integrated Pest Management practices.\n\n&gt; **For Farmer Field Schools:**\n\n\n  - The entity/organization should be a Farmer Field School.\n  - The entity/organization should be interested in conducting a Demonstration and Training program for the Farmers.\n\n"
        },
        "schemeContent": {
          "benefitTypes": {
            "id": 1,
            "label": "Cash",
            "value": "cash"
          },
          "benefits": [
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "bold": true,
                          "text": "For Farmer Field Schools: "
                        },
                        {
                          "text": "Financial Assistance: Grants of ₹17,000/- is allowed towards Demonstration of 40 Ha. each and Training per Farmers Field School through cluster approach."
                        }
                      ],
                      "type": "list_item"
                    },
                    {
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "bold": true,
                          "text": "For Farmers: "
                        },
                        {
                          "text": "Training & Demonstration: Hands-on training in pest management through Farmer Field Schools."
                        }
                      ],
                      "type": "list_item"
                    }
                  ],
                  "type": "ul_list"
                }
              ],
              "type": "align_justify"
            },
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": ""
                }
              ],
              "type": "paragraph"
            }
          ],
          "benefits_md": "\n  - **For Farmer Field Schools:** Financial Assistance: Grants of ₹17,000/- is allowed towards Demonstration of 40 Ha. each and Training per Farmers Field School through cluster approach.  - **For Farmers:** Training &amp;amp; Demonstration: Hands-on training in pest management through Farmer Field Schools.\n<br>\n\n",
          "briefDescription": "The “Integrated Pest Management Demonstration Cum Training” scheme provides financial assistance for 30 farmers to conduct pest management demonstrations and training using a cluster approach in Farmer Field Schools.\n",
          "detailedDescription": [
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "The “Integrated Pest Management Demonstration Cum Training” scheme by the Agriculture-Farmers Welfare Department, Tamil Nadu, supports pest management practices through demonstrations and training in Farmer Field Schools. Financial assistance is granted for each 40-hectare demonstration and training cluster. The scheme aims to enhance pest control knowledge among farmers, helping them manage pests effectively while reducing reliance on chemical pesticides."
                    }
                  ],
                  "type": "paragraph"
                }
              ],
              "type": "align_justify"
            }
          ],
          "detailedDescription_md": "The “Integrated Pest Management Demonstration Cum Training” scheme by the Agriculture-Farmers Welfare Department, Tamil Nadu, supports pest management practices through demonstrations and training in Farmer Field Schools. Financial assistance is granted for each 40-hectare demonstration and training cluster. The scheme aims to enhance pest control knowledge among farmers, helping them manage pests effectively while reducing reliance on chemical pesticides.\n",
          "exclusions": [
